11. Conclusion

This thesis proposes Evidence-Constrained Scientific Discovery (ECSD), a framework for the epistemically controlled transition from multimodal evidence to persistent, falsifiable representations of scientific ignorance. The v0.7 revision addresses four residual technical vulnerabilities from v0.6:

1. E-value aggregation is corrected from multiplicative to convex arithmetic, valid under arbitrary spatial dependence by the theorem in §5.2.
2. The dependency kernel K_{ij} is redefined as a partial distance correlation with correct orientation and PSD projection.
3. The common observable space \mathcal{O} is decoupled from probe expressivity via capacity-constrained non-linear probes.
4. The FDR result is downgraded from a theorem to a conditional proposition, with a simulation study to test robustness under assumption violations.

The v0.7 contribution is a dependence-corrected protocol suite. Each component is specified step by step: how to calibrate K_{ij} via partial distance correlation on three ground-truth tiers, how to aggregate e-values under arbitrary spatial dependence by arithmetic mean, how to calibrate KC as a probabilistic classifier, and how to construct a common physical observable space via capacity-constrained probes. No experiments are reported; the protocols are the contribution.

The ultimate loop:

\boxed{\text{Observe} \to \text{Represent} \to \text{Detect} \to \text{Compare} \to \text{Quantify uncertainty} \to \text{Identify gap} \to \text{Ask} \to \text{Hypothesize} \to \text{Test} \to \text{Learn} \to \text{Find the next gap}.}

The conceptual result is precise:

\boxed{\textbf{ECSD is not a machine that discovers truth.}}

\boxed{\textbf{ECSD is a controlled mechanism for deciding when an observed discrepancy is admissible as a persistent candidate of scientific ignorance.}}

AutoSciDACT already covers statistical novelty detection. SGHA already covers research-problem discovery from literature. The bridge between them — controlled empirical observation → discrepancy → knowledge insufficiency → falsifiable gap — is precisely where ECSD must now prove its value.

